flowchart LR
    U[用户浏览器]

    subgraph WEB["Web 前端 / BFF（新增 web/）"]
        MW[访问中间件<br/>会话校验 / CSRF / 安全头 / Request ID]
        UI[Next.js 页面<br/>Server Components + 少量 Client Components]
        BFF[BFF Route Handlers<br/>参数校验 / API 聚合 / 错误转换]
        CLIENT[FastAPI Client<br/>Bearer 注入 / 超时 / Trace ID]
    end

    subgraph BACKEND["现有 FastAPI 后端（尽量不改）"]
        API["/api/v1"]
        AUTH[Bearer Token 认证]
        THESIS[Thesis API]
        EVENT[Event API]
        MONITOR[确定性监控服务]
        REPO[SQLAlchemy Repository]
    end

    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    PROVIDERS[Alpha Vantage<br/>Finnhub<br/>Yahoo Finance]
    INGEST[现有 CLI / Cron 采集]

    U -->|同源 HTTPS| MW
    MW --> UI
    UI --> BFF
    BFF --> CLIENT
    CLIENT -->|服务端 Bearer Token| API

    API --> AUTH
    AUTH --> THESIS
    AUTH --> EVENT
    THESIS --> MONITOR
    THESIS --> REPO
    EVENT --> REPO
    MONITOR --> REPO
    REPO --> DB

    PROVIDERS --> INGEST
    INGEST --> DB
